---
import SlideLayout from '../../../layouts/SlideLayout.astro';
---
<SlideLayout
  title="Slide 02 - ADR jako zapis decyzji"
  bgImage="/images/background-3.jpg"
  bgOverlay="linear-gradient(rgba(10,14,23,0.74), rgba(10,14,23,0.88))"
>
  <div class="content">
    <h1 class="title">
      ADR jako <span class="highlight">zapis decyzji</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="doc" aria-label="Definicja ADR przez trzy pytania">
      <div class="doc-head">
        <div class="doc-head-left">
          <i class="ti ti-file-text"></i>
          <div class="doc-meta">
            <span class="doc-id">ADR-0042</span>
            <span class="doc-name">Architecture Decision Record</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card card--1">
          <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="ti ti-target-arrow"></i></div>
          <h3>Jaka decyzja?</h3>
          <span class="divider"></span>
          <p>Jednoznaczny zapis wyboru, który określa kierunek dalszego projektowania i implementacji.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card card--2">
          <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="ti ti-map-pin"></i></div>
          <h3>W jakim kontekście?</h3>
          <span class="divider"></span>
          <p>Uzasadnienie decyzji osadzone w wymaganiach, ograniczeniach i realiach zespołu w danym momencie.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card card--3">
          <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="ti ti-scale"></i></div>
          <h3>Jakie konsekwencje?</h3>
          <span class="divider"></span>
          <p>Świadomie zaakceptowane skutki techniczne, organizacyjne i biznesowe wynikające z wyboru.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</SlideLayout>

<style is:global>
  .stage {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 1640px;
    padding: 110px 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.15s forwards;
  }

  .title {
    font-size: 84px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.32s forwards;
  }

  .title .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan-400), var(--cyan-600));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 1240px;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.42;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.5s forwards;
  }

  .lead strong {
    color: #f1f5f9;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .doc {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1480px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.62);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
    border-radius: 26px;
    padding: 28px 30px 36px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(24px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out 0.7s forwards;
  }

  .doc-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 6px 8px 22px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.28);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .doc-head-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .doc-head i {
    font-size: 42px;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
  }

  .doc-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .doc-id {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  }

  .doc-name {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #94a3b8;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .doc-badge {
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.35);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 44px 32px 38px;
    text-align: center;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .card--1 { animation-delay: 0.95s; }
  .card--2 { animation-delay: 1.12s; }
  .card--3 { animation-delay: 1.29s; }

  .step-num {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    right: 22px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.6);
  }

  .icon-wrap {
    width: 104px;
    height: 104px;
    margin: 0 auto 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.18), rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.04) 70%);
  }

  .icon-wrap i {
    font-size: 54px;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    line-height: 1.18;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }

  .divider {
    display: block;
    width: 44px;
    height: 2px;
    margin: 0 auto 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--cyan-500), transparent);
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to   { opacity: 1; }
  }
</style>
